Z||000026||artherd||10-21-2001||02:03 AM||||HELL YEAH!!!<P>Keep it up man, play with refining it, and possibly legenthening the intake runners a bit?  (the really short ones you now have probally start to really resonate around 10,000rpms now, which is a tad high  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Way cool though, and I *really* like the look, it could be really pretty when all done up with good shiney-love-mojo.<P>DUAL TBs, aww yeah  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
