Z||000047||fiero87||10-22-2001||01:20 AM||||Cooter,<P>Try using the stock chip with an Apexi S-afc<BR>It intercepts the map sensor data and modifies it to correct for increased airflow, or bigger injectors.   We use them all the time on DSM's here at my shop.  They work great and are extremely user friendly.  It should help you to get the best air-fuel mixture to maximize your power.  Just a thought anyway.  <BR>Tim||||reg||1
